    "%@; %@" : {
      "comment" : "Joins two parts of a status line with a semicolon. %1$@ is the text so far and %2$@ the next part. English puts a semicolon and a space between them.\nLibrary view editor: adds one more clause to a filter's description. %1$@ is the description so far and %2$@ the clause added after a semicolon.",
