    "Delete" : {
      "comment" : "A command on a bookmark of the Bookmarks list, as a button beside its row, a VoiceOver action, and a context menu item: deletes the bookmark.\nName of a key of the keyboard, spoken by VoiceOver and shown in braille in a keyboard shortcut such as \"Command + Delete\".\nName of the command that deletes a substitution rule: a row button's label and tooltip, a VoiceOver action, and a context menu item.\nText of the Library tab of Settings, a list of the views the Library window offers (built-in views and the listener's own). The question's button that deletes.",
