                  "value" : "Episodes (%lld)"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Equals" : {
      "comment" : "Name of the punctuation key \"=\", spoken by VoiceOver and shown in braille in a keyboard shortcut such as \"Command + Equals\"."
    },
    "Error" : {
      "comment" : "Title of an alert about a problem, when the problem has no more specific title.\nTitle of the reader's alert about a problem that is not an audio failure."
    },
    "Error: %@" : {
      "comment" : "What VoiceOver says for the refusal shown under a jump panel's field. %@ is the refusal's sentence."
    },
    "Escape" : {
      "comment" : "Name of a key of the keyboard, spoken by VoiceOver and shown in braille in a keyboard shortcut such as \"Command + Escape\"."
    },
    "Every book above it in the reading list is finished" : {
      "comment" : "A sentence of the announcement as a book read from the reading list ends while the list plays upward: the books above it are all finished, and the list passes over finished books. Written without its full stop.",
      "localizations" : {
