    },
    "Move Up" : {
      "comment" : "Name of the command that moves a substitution rule up the list: a row button's label and tooltip, a VoiceOver action, and a context menu item.\nText of the Library tab of Settings, a list of the views the Library window offers (built-in views and the listener's own). The command that moves a view one place up, as a VoiceOver action and a context menu item."
    },
