    "Not in the Reading List" : {
      "comment" : "Text of the Library view editor sheet, which makes and changes a view of the Library window, and of the descriptions of a view's filter. A condition's relation as its relation pop-up names it, by its test and whether it is negated. This is the form for the first case of the condition."
    },
    "Not known until the book is downloaded" : {
      "comment" : "Text of Speak Info, Book Information's braille code and text encoding rows, and the re-read alerts. The pop-up's value for a book that records no encoding and whose file is only in the cloud, which is never downloaded to learn it."
