    "Redo" : {
      "comment" : "Name of a key of the keyboard, spoken by VoiceOver and shown in braille in a keyboard shortcut such as \"Command + Redo\".\nName of a keyboard shortcut action, listed in Settings in the audio editor group and read by VoiceOver. Does the last undone edit again.\nName of the Edit menu's Redo command, in a sentence saying why a keyboard shortcut cannot take its key."
