    "Remove" : {
      "comment" : "Button of the iPhone's question before a bookmark is removed: removes the bookmark, which deletes it.\nText of the Library view editor sheet, which makes and changes a view of the Library window, and of the descriptions of a view's filter. The remove button's visible title.",
