    "Save" : {
      "comment" : "Button of the book information sheet that saves the edits.\nButton that keeps what was typed or changed in a sheet and closes it, such as a bookmark's note, a book's information, or a library view's name.\nButton that saves the changes made in a sheet.\nName of a keyboard shortcut action, listed in Settings in the audio editor group and read by VoiceOver. Saves the edited audio.\nText of the Library view editor sheet, which makes and changes a view of the Library window, and of the descriptions of a view's filter. The button that saves the view.\nTitle of the button that saves an edited substitution rule, in the rule editor.\nTitle of the question's default button when the Record window is closed with a recording that could not be saved: it tries to save it again.",
